OL,3,GNEWSAThe blind musician singing in the
OL,4,Aface of adversity
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn award-winning singer, who was born
OL,7,Fwith severely impaired vision, has said
OL,8,Fthere is "so much that can be gained by
OL,9,Finclusion and diversity".
OL,11,FFolk musician Elena Piras is originally
OL,12,Ffrom Sardinia, Italy, and now lives in
OL,13,FCharlbury, Oxfordshire, where she has
OL,14,Frecorded her latest single.
OL,16,FIn addition to her visual disability,
OL,17,Fshe was also left with severe hearing
OL,18,Floss after being caught up in the 7/7
OL,19,FLondon bombings in 2005.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
